CROSS SECTION COVARANCE DATA                                      9040 1451
R. Capote Noy and A. Trkov, IAEA                                  9040 1451
                                                                  9040 1451
Cross section covariance data were generated by the Monte Carlo   9040 1451
technique [1] using the EMPIRE nuclear model code. The covariance 9040 1451
matrix was used as a prior in the GANDR system [2]. GANDR was let 9040 1451
to update the covariance matrix on the basis of experimental data 9040 1451
from EXFOR. The following data from EXFOR were included in the    9040 1451
analysis:                                                         9040 1451
                                                                  9040 1451
