uncertainty was acknowledged by Abfalterer in a publication.      9040 1451
By analogy, the same is adopted for all measurements. In addition,9040 1451
a 0.2% fully correlated uncertainty was assumed between all       9040 1451
measurements.                                                     9040 1451
